# Fixtures are checked in as data and read verbatim by the C# test harness: the WAVs and the
# style tensor are compared against the port's output, and ids.txt/phonemes.txt are parsed
# character by character. The repository-wide "text=auto eol=crlf" must not rewrite them.
*.wav  binary
*.bin  binary
*.txt  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
